  1	## Mandatory HTML Skeleton
  2	
  3	**EVERY visualization MUST start from this skeleton.** Copy it, then add content. This gives you themes, print styles, Inter font, animations, menu, and hover effects — all working out of the box.
  4	
  5	**Design philosophy: CSS-first, JS-minimal.** Animations use CSS `@keyframes` and `transition` (always reliable). JavaScript is only for: menu, theme toggle, scroll observer, number counters, and PNG download. No animation libraries required.
  6	
  7	```html
  8	<!DOCTYPE html>
  9	<html lang="en" class="theme-dark">
 10	<head>
 11	  <meta charset="UTF-8">
 12	  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
 13	  <title>YOUR TITLE HERE</title>
 14	  <!-- fonts pre-installed at /app/libs/fonts/ -->
 15	  <link href="/app/libs/fonts/inter.css" rel="stylesheet">
 16	  <!-- ADD LANGUAGE FONTS IF NEEDED: e.g. Noto Sans KR for Korean, Noto Sans JP for Japanese -->
 17	  <!-- <link href="/app/libs/fonts/noto-sans-kr.css" rel="stylesheet"> -->
 18	  <!-- ADD CDN LIBRARIES HERE (Chart.js, Mermaid, etc.) -->
 19	  <script src="/app/libs/html-to-image.js"></script>
 20	  <style>
 21	    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
 22	    :root { interpolate-size: allow-keywords; } /* Enable smooth height:auto transitions (Chrome 129+) */
 23	
 24	    /* ===== THEMES (class-based ONLY — no @media prefers-color-scheme) ===== */
 25	    html.theme-dark {
 26	      --bg: #0A0A0A; --surface: #141414; --surface-hover: #1C1C1C;
 27	      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
 28	      --text: #EDEDED; --text-secondary: #888;
 29	      --accent: #3b82f6; --accent-secondary: #8b5cf6;
 30	      --positive: #10b981; --negative: #f43f5e; --warning: #f59e0b;
 31	    }
 32	    html.theme-light {
 33	      --bg: #FAFAF9; --surface: #FFFFFF; --surface-hover: #F5F5F4;
 34	      --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
 35	      --text: #0f172a; --text-secondary: #64748b;
 36	      --accent: #2563eb; --accent-secondary: #7c3aed;
 37	      --positive: #059669; --negative: #e11d48; --warning: #d97706;
 38	    }
 39	
 40	    body {
 41	      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
 42	      background: var(--bg); color: var(--text);
 43	      line-height: 1.6; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
 44	      letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-feature-settings: 'cv11', 'ss01';
 45	      transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;
 46	      scrollbar-gutter: stable;
 47	    }
 48	    h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6 { 
 49	      color: var(--text); 
 50	      letter-spacing: -0.03em; 
 51	      line-height: 1.08;
 52	      text-wrap: balance;
 53	    }
 54	    h1 { font-weight: 700; }
 55	    h2 { font-weight: 600; }
 56	    body, p, li, td, th, span, label { font-weight: 400; }
 57	    p,li,td,th,span,label { color: var(--text); }
 58	    .text-secondary { color: var(--text-secondary); }
 59	
 60	    /* ===== CARD ===== */
 61	    .card {
 62	      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
 63	      border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px;
 64	      transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease;
 65	    }
 66	    .card:hover {
 67	      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--border), 0 8px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
 68	    }
 69	
 70	    /* ===== ANIMATIONS (CSS-first — always reliable) ===== */
 71	    @keyframes fadeInUp {
 72	      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
 73	      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
 74	    }
 75	    @keyframes fadeIn {
 76	      from { opacity: 0; }
 77	      to { opacity: 1; }
 78	    }
 79	    @keyframes slideInLeft {
 80	      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-40px); }
 81	      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
 82	    }
 83	    @keyframes slideInRight {
 84	      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(40px); }
 85	      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
 86	    }
 87	    .animate { animation: fadeInUp 0.6s ease-out both; }
 88	    .animate.delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
 89	    .animate.delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
 90	    .animate.delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
 91	    .animate.delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
 92	    .animate.delay-5 { animation-delay: 0.5s; }
 93	    .animate.delay-6 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }
 94	
 95	    /* Scroll-triggered: JS adds .reveal, then .visible on scroll */
 96	    .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
 97	    .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
 98	
 99	    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
100	      *, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important; transition: none !important; }
101	      .reveal { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
102	    }
103	
104	    /* ===== PRINT ===== */
105	    @media print {
106	      body { background: white !important; color: black !important; }
107	      .viz-menu, .reveal { display: revert; opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
108	      .card { break-inside: avoid; border: 1px solid #ddd; box-shadow: none; }
109	      * { print-color-adjust: exact; -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; }
110	    }
111	    @page { margin: 1in; @bottom-center { content: "Page " counter(page); font-size: 9pt; color: #666; } }
112	
113	    /* ===== MENU ===== */
114	    .viz-menu { position: fixed; top: 16px; right: 16px; z-index: 9999; }
115	    .viz-menu-toggle {
116	      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px;
117	      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
118	      color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; display: flex;
119	      align-items: center; justify-content: center;
120	      backdrop-filter: blur(12px); transition: all 0.2s;
121	    }
122	    .viz-menu-toggle:hover { background: var(--surface-hover); }
123	    .viz-menu-dropdown {
124	      position: absolute; top: 52px; right: 0; min-width: 200px;
125	      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
126	      border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px;
127	      opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(-8px);
128	      transition: all 0.2s; backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
129	    }
130	    .viz-menu-dropdown.open { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
131	    .viz-menu-dropdown button {
132	      width: 100%; padding: 10px 14px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;
133	      background: transparent; color: var(--text); font-size: 14px;
134	      font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; text-align: left;
135	      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; transition: background 0.15s;
136	    }
137	    .viz-menu-dropdown button:hover { background: var(--surface-hover); }
138	
139	    /* ===== SKIP TO CONTENT (accessibility) ===== */
140	    .skip-to-content {
141	      position: absolute; top: -40px; left: 6px; background: var(--accent);
142	      color: white; padding: 8px 12px; text-decoration: none;
143	      border-radius: 4px; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none;
144	      transition: all 0.2s; z-index: 10000;
145	    }
146	    .skip-to-content:focus { top: 6px; opacity: 1; pointer-events: auto; }
147	
148	    /* ===== DETAILS ACCORDION (Chrome 120+ exclusive, 131+ animated) ===== */
149	    details { overflow: hidden; }
150	    details summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; }
151	    details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
152	    ::details-content {
153	      transition: block-size 0.3s ease, opacity 0.3s ease;
154	      block-size: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden;
155	    }
156	    details[open]::details-content { block-size: auto; opacity: 1; }
157	
158	    /* ===== POPOVER (Chrome 114+, zero-JS tooltips/panels) ===== */
159	    [popover] {
160	      background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);
161	      border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px; max-width: 320px;
162	      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); color: var(--text);
163	    }
164	    [popover]::backdrop { background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
165	
166	    /* ===== ADD YOUR STYLES BELOW ===== */
167	  </style>
168	</head>
169	<body>
170	  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-link" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;z-index:10000;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;" onfocus="this.style.cssText='position:fixed;left:16px;top:16px;z-index:10000;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;'" onblur="this.style.cssText='position:absolute;left:-9999px;top:auto;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;'">Skip to content</a>
171	  <main id="main-content">
172	
173	  <!-- MENU -->
174	  <div class="viz-menu">
175	    <button class="viz-menu-toggle" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Menu">
176	      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
177	        <line x1="3" y1="5" x2="17" y2="5"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="17" y2="10"/><line x1="3" y1="15" x2="17" y2="15"/>
178	      </svg>
179	    </button>
180	    <div class="viz-menu-dropdown" id="vizMenuDropdown">
181	      <button onclick="cycleTheme()"><span id="themeIcon">🌙</span><span id="themeLabel">Dark</span></button>
182	      <button onclick="downloadImage()"><span>📥</span><span>Download PNG</span></button>
183	      <button onclick="window.print()"><span>🖨️</span><span>Print / PDF</span></button>
184	    </div>
185	  </div>
186	
187	  <!-- SKIP TO CONTENT (accessibility) -->
188	  <a href="#main-content" class="skip-to-content">Skip to content</a>
189	
190	  <main id="main-content" role="main">
191	    <!-- YOUR CONTENT HERE (use <section>, <header>, <article> for semantics) -->
192	  </main>
193	
194	  <!-- EXAMPLE: Exclusive accordion (only one open at a time, no JS needed) -->
195	  <!--
196	  <details name="faq" open>
197	    <summary>Section 1</summary>
198	    <div class="section-body"><p>Content</p></div>
199	  </details>
200	  <details name="faq">
201	    <summary>Section 2</summary>
202	    <div class="section-body"><p>Content</p></div>
203	  </details>
204	  -->
205	
206	  <!-- EXAMPLE: Popover (zero-JS tooltip/info panel) -->
207	  <!--
208	  <button popovertarget="info-panel">Details</button>
209	  <div id="info-panel" popover>
210	    <h3>More Information</h3>
211	    <p>Content shown on click, no JS needed.</p>
212	  </div>
213	  -->
214	
215	  </main>
216	  <script>
217	    // === Menu ===
218	    function toggleMenu() { 
219	      var dropdown = document.getElementById('vizMenuDropdown') || document.getElementById('vizMenu');
220	      if (dropdown) dropdown.classList.toggle('open'); 
221	    }
222	    document.addEventListener('click', e => { 
223	      if (!e.target.closest('.viz-menu')) {
224	        var dropdown = document.getElementById('vizMenuDropdown') || document.getElementById('vizMenu');
225	        if (dropdown) dropdown.classList.remove('open');
226	      }
227	    });
228	    document.addEventListener('keydown', e => { 
229	      if (e.key === 'Escape') {
230	        var dropdown = document.getElementById('vizMenuDropdown') || document.getElementById('vizMenu');
231	        if (dropdown) dropdown.classList.remove('open');
232	      }
233	    });
234	
235	    // === Theme (class-based, OS detection on first visit) ===
236	    var savedTheme = localStorage.getItem('viz-theme');
237	    var currentTheme = savedTheme || (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)').matches ? 'light' : 'dark');
238	    function applyTheme(t) {
239	      document.documentElement.className = 'theme-' + t;
240	      document.getElementById('themeIcon').textContent = t === 'dark' ? '🌙' : '☀️';
241	      document.getElementById('themeLabel').textContent = t === 'dark' ? 'Dark' : 'Light';
242	      localStorage.setItem('viz-theme', t);
243	      currentTheme = t;
244	      if (typeof onThemeChange === 'function') onThemeChange();
245	    }
246	    function cycleTheme() { applyTheme(currentTheme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark'); }
247	    applyTheme(currentTheme);
248	
249	    // === Scroll Reveal (adds .reveal then .visible — content visible without JS) ===
250	    document.querySelectorAll('[data-reveal]').forEach(el => el.classList.add('reveal'));
251	    var revealObserver = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries) {
252	      entries.forEach(function(e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { e.target.classList.add('visible'); revealObserver.unobserve(e.target); } });
253	    }, { threshold: 0.15 });
254	    document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => revealObserver.observe(el));
255	
256	    // === Number Counter (use data-count="77" data-suffix="%" on elements) ===
257	    function animateCounters() {
258	      document.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(function(el) {
259	        if (el.dataset.counted) return;
260	        el.dataset.counted = '1';
261	        var target = parseFloat(el.dataset.count), prefix = el.dataset.prefix || '', suffix = el.dataset.suffix || '';
262	        var start = performance.now(), duration = 1200;
263	        (function tick(now) {
264	          var p = Math.min((now - start) / duration, 1), eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - p, 3);
265	          el.textContent = prefix + Math.round(target * eased).toLocaleString() + suffix;
266	          if (p < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
267	        })(start);
268	      });
269	    }
270	    var counterEl = document.querySelector('[data-count]');
271	    if (counterEl) {
272	      var cObs = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries) {
273	        entries.forEach(function(e) { if (e.isIntersecting) { animateCounters(); cObs.disconnect(); } });
274	      }, { threshold: 0.3 });
275	      cObs.observe(counterEl);
276	    }
277	
278	    // === Download PNG ===
279	    async function downloadImage() {
280	      var menu = document.querySelector('.viz-menu');
281	      menu.style.display = 'none';
282	      try {
283	        var url = await htmlToImage.toPng(document.body, { quality: 1, pixelRatio: 2, filter: function(n) { return !n.classList || !n.classList.contains('viz-menu'); } });
284	        var a = document.createElement('a'); a.href = url;
285	        a.download = document.title.replace(/\s+/g, '-').toLowerCase() + '.png'; a.click();
286	      } catch(e) { console.error('Download failed:', e); }
287	      menu.style.display = '';
288	    }
289	
290	    // === Chart.js Pattern (use when file has Chart.js) ===
291	    // var chartsBuilt = false;
292	    // function buildCharts() {
293	    //   if (chartsBuilt || typeof Chart === 'undefined') return;
294	    //   var isDark = document.documentElement.classList.contains('theme-dark');
295	    //   var textColor = isDark ? '#EDEDED' : '#0f172a';
296	    //   var borderColor = isDark ? 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)' : 'rgba(0,0,0,0.1)';
297	    //   // Create charts with theme-aware colors
298	    //   chartsBuilt = true;
299	    // }
300	    // function onThemeChange() { chartsBuilt = false; buildCharts(); }
301	    // window.addEventListener('load', buildCharts);
302	
303	    // === YOUR SCRIPTS BELOW (use var for top-level variables, define onThemeChange for chart re-renders) ===
304	  </script>
305	</body>
306	</html>
307	```
308	
309	### Skeleton Rules
310	
311	**Do:**
312	- Use `var` for all top-level variables (avoids TDZ errors when functions are hoisted)
313	- Use `data-reveal` attribute on sections/cards for scroll animation
314	- Use `data-count="77" data-suffix="%"` for animated number counters
315	- Use `.animate.delay-N` classes for page-load entrance animations
316	- Use CSS `:hover` for hover effects (baked into `.card` already)
317	- Define `function onThemeChange() {}` to re-render charts on theme toggle
318	- Use `<main>`, `<section>`, `<header>`, `<article>` for semantic HTML
319	- Keep all chart variables as `var` (not `let`/`const`) at script top level
320	
321	**Don't:**
322	- Don't include Motion.js unless you specifically need spring physics
323	- Don't hide content via JS/CSS for animation — use `data-reveal` pattern instead
324	- Don't use `let`/`const` for variables that might be referenced before declaration
325	- Don't use `.finished` Promise chains for sequencing — use `setTimeout`
326	- Don't put animation logic that could crash before nav/chart setup code
